# Wave W15-T4 (Revelry TV tower): revtvcap-c — the broadcast centre cap of the Revelry TV tower, 16x48, bottom-anchored on the station's existing roof row (Premium+ W6 TX-3). A gold-cored beacon crowns a deep white dish on a mullion mast; below, the shaft stacks beamroof's own steel-glass bands, so the tower grows out of the station's T42 register and no other building in the fleet wears it. Worn twice across the roof run (x=16,17). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-W15-LANDMARKS-PLAN.md §1.7/§2.)
PIX tile-revtvcap-c 16 48
